 serif' }}\n          >\n            Mirellé is a research-driven nail editorial platform. We are not nail technicians or licensed beauty professionals. We are researchers and curators who track market signals, search demand, and consumer behavior in the nail space. This page explains how we work.\n          </p>\n\n          <div\n            className=\"font-body text-base text-foreground/70 leading-relaxed space-y-16\"\n            style={{ fontFamily: 'Crimson Text, Georgia, serif' }}\n          >\n\n            <div>\n              <h2\n                className=\"font-heading text-2xl text-foreground mb-4\"\n                style={{ fontFamily: 'Larken, Georgia, serif' }}\n              >\n                How content is researched\n              </h2>\n              <p className=\"mb-4\">\n                Every content decision at Mirellé starts with data. Ri tracks Pinterest trend signals, organic search volume, and market behavior to identify what people are actually looking for in the nail space. Topics are selected based on real demand, not editorial whim.\n              </p>\n              <p>\n                We analyze what is growing on Pinterest, what search queries are rising, and where there are gaps in existing content. That research drives our content calendar. We do not publish trend content because it feels timely. We publish it because the data shows it is timely.\n              </p>\n            </div>\n\n            <div>\n              <h2\n                className=\"font-heading text-2xl text-foreground mb-4\"\n                style={{ fontFamily: 'Larken, Georgia, serif' }}\n              >\n                Who writes what\n              </h2>\n              <p className=\"mb-4\">\n                Ri handles research, topic planning, trend reports, business content, and editorial direction. Jyoti writes all published content: blog posts, FAQs, work-nails pieces, spotlights, and social copy. She also manages our Pinterest and community engagement.\n              </p>\n              <p>\n                Every piece of content is written by Jyoti based on a brief informed by Ri's research. Nothing goes live without passing through both of them.\n              </p>\n            </div>\n\n            <div>\n              <h2\n                className=\"font-heading text-2xl text-foreground mb-4\"\n                style={{ fontFamily: 'Larken, Georgia, serif' }}\n              >\n                Our positioning\n              </h2>\n              <p className=\"mb-4\">\n                We are curators, not practitioners. We do not perform nail services, test products ourselves, or claim technical expertise. What we do is understand the nail market at a research level  what consumers want, what trends are building, what content is missing.\n              </p>\n              <p>\n                When we recommend products, those recommendations are based on research, community signals, and market analysis  not personal testing. We are transparent about this. See our{' '}\n                <Link\n                  href=\"/disclosures\"\n                  className=\"font-ui text-sm uppercase tracking-wide underline hover:no-underline text-foreground\"\n                >\n                  disclosures page\n                </Link>{' '}\n                for full detail on how affiliate and sponsored content is handled.\n              </p>\n            </div>\n\n            <div>\n              <h2\n                className=\"font-heading text-2xl text-foreground mb-4\"\n                style={{ fontFamily: 'Larken, Georgia, serif' }}\n              >\n                Editorial independence\n              </h2>\n              <p className=\"mb-4\">\n                No brand, sponsor, or partner has editorial control over our content. Paid partnerships are clearly disclosed. Organic editorial content is never influenced by commercial relationships.\n              </p>\n              <p>\n                If a product or brand appears in editorial content without a disclosure, it is there because our research indicated it was relevant and useful to our readers. If it is sponsored or affiliated, it is disclosed.\n              </p>\n            </div>\n\n            <div>\n              <h2\n                className=\"font-heading text-2xl text-foreground mb-4\"\n                style={{ fontFamily: 'Larken, Georgia, serif' }}\n              >\n                Affiliate links\n              </h2>\n              <p>\n                Some content on Mirellé contains affiliate links, primarily through Amazon Associates and other affiliate programs. When you purchase through these links we may earn a commission at no extra cost to you. Affiliate relationships do not influence which products are featured or how they are described in editorial content. All affiliate placements are disclosed.\n              </p>\n            </div>\n\n            <div>\n              <h2\n                className=\"font-heading text-2xl text-foreground mb-4\"\n                style={{ fontFamily: 'Larken, Georgia, serif' }}\n              >\n                Content updates\n              </h2>\n              <p>\n                We update content when trend data indicates a piece is no longer accurate or when something in the nail market has shifted materially. Evergreen content is reviewed periodically. Trend-specific content is updated seasonally or when search behavior changes significantly.\n              </p>\n            </div>\n\n            <div>\n              <h2\n                className=\"font-heading text-2xl text-foreground mb-4\"\n                style={{ fontFamily: 'Larken, Georgia, serif' }}\n              >\n                Accuracy and corrections\n              </h2>\n              <p>\n                We aim for accuracy in all published content. If you spot an error, contact us at{' '}\n                <a\n                  href=\"mailto:contact@mirelleinspo.com\"\n       