This page explains every commercial relationship that may affect the content you read on this site.\n          </p>\n\n          <div\n            className=\"font-body text-base text-foreground/70 leading-relaxed space-y-16\"\n            style={{ fontFamily: 'Crimson Text, Georgia, serif' }}\n          >\n\n            <div>\n              <h2\n                className=\"font-heading text-2xl text-foreground mb-4\"\n                style={{ fontFamily: 'Larken, Georgia, serif' }}\n              >\n                Affiliate links\n              </h2>\n              <p className=\"mb-4\">\n                Mirellé participates in affiliate marketing programs including Amazon Associates and other affiliate networks. Some links on this site are affiliate links. When you click one of these links and make a purchase, we may earn a commission at no additional cost to you.\n              </p>\n              <p className=\"mb-4\">\n                Affiliate links are used across blog posts, FAQs, and product-related content. Posts containing affiliate links are not written to promote a product for commission purposes. Topics are selected based on search demand and reader interest. The presence of an affiliate link does not mean a product was tested, endorsed, or recommended over alternatives based on commercial incentive.\n              </p>\n              <p>\n                We are a participant in the Amazon Services LLC Associates Program, an affiliate advertising program designed to provide a means for sites to earn advertising fees by advertising and linking to Amazon.com.\n              </p>\n            </div>\n\n            <div>\n              <h2\n                className=\"font-heading text-2xl text-foreground mb-4\"\n                style={{ fontFamily: 'Larken, Georgia, serif' }}\n              >\n                Sponsored content\n              </h2>\n              <p className=\"mb-4\">\n                Some content on Mirellé is paid for by brands or businesses. Any post, feature, or placement that is sponsored is clearly labeled \"Sponsored\" or \"Paid Partnership\" at the top of that content.\n              </p>\n              <p>\n                Sponsored content does not influence organic editorial decisions. Brands cannot pay to appear in non-sponsored editorial content, and no brand has editorial control over how they are described in any content on this site.\n              </p>\n            </div>\n\n            <div>\n              <h2\n                className=\"font-heading text-2xl text-foreground mb-4\"\n                style={{ fontFamily: 'Larken, Georgia, serif' }}\n              >\n                Pinterest\n              </h2>\n              <p className=\"mb-4\">\n                Mirellé manages a Pinterest account with 1M monthly visitors. Some pins on that account may be part of paid partnerships or sponsored placements. Sponsored pins are disclosed in the pin description.\n              </p>\n              <p>\n                Organic pins  the majority of our Pinterest activity  are curated based on aesthetic quality, search relevance, and audience interest. No payment is required or accepted for organic pin placement.\n              </p>\n            </div>\n\n            <div>\n              <h2\n                className=\"font-heading text-2xl text-foreground mb-4\"\n                style={{ fontFamily: 'Larken, Georgia, serif' }}\n              >\n                Advertising\n              </h2>\n              <p>\n                Mirellé displays advertisements through Google AdSense and may use other third-party ad networks. These ads are served automatically based on page content and user behavior. Advertisers have no influence over editorial content. Ad placements are separate from editorial decisions.\n              </p>\n            </div>\n\n            <div>\n              <h2\n                className=\"font-heading text-2xl text-foreground mb-4\"\n                style={{ fontFamily: 'Larken, Georgia, serif' }}\n              >\n                Product recommendations\n              </h2>\n              <p className=\"mb-4\">\n                We are researchers and curators, not nail technicians or product testers. Products featured on Mirellé are selected based on market research, search demand, community signals, and publicly available information  not personal testing or hands-on evaluation.\n              </p>\n              <p>\n                We do not claim to have personally used, tested, or evaluated any product unless explicitly stated. When a product appears in editorial content, it is because our research indicated it was relevant and useful to our audience.\n              </p>\n            </div>\n\n            <div>\n              <h2\n                className=\"font-heading text-2xl text-foreground mb-4\"\n                style={{ fontFamily: 'Larken, Georgia, serif' }}\n              >\n                FTC compliance\n              </h2>\n              <p>\n                In accordance with the Federal Trade Commission's guidelines on endorsements and testimonials, we disclose all material connections between Mirellé and any brand, product, or service mentioned on this site. This includes affiliate relationships, sponsored content, gifted products, and paid partnerships.\n              </p>\n            </div>\n\n            <div className=\"pt-4 border-t border-foreground/10\">\n              <p>\n                Questions about any of these disclosures? Contact us at{' '}\n                <a\n                  href=\"mailto:contact@mirelleinspo.com\"\n                  className=\"font-ui text-sm uppercase tracking-wide underline hover:no-underline text-foreground\"\n                >\n                  contact@mirelleinspo.com\n                </a>\n                . For more on how we make editorial decisions, see our{' '}\n                <Link\n                  href=\"/editorial-policy\"\n                  className=\"font-ui text-sm uppercase tracking-wide underline hover:no-underline text-foreground\"\n                >\n                  editorial policy\n                </Link>.\n              </p>\n            </div>\n\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </section>\n    </div>\n  );\n}"
